<title>UK: Deutsche sets warrants on German govt bonds.</title>
<headline>Deutsche sets warrants on German govt bonds.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>DB Capital Markets (Deutschland) has issued six million American-style call and put warrants, in six equal tranches, on German government bonds, lead manager Deutsche Morgan Grenfell said.</p>
<p> WARRANTS  STRIKE     ISS PRICE  PREMIUM   GEARING   MATURITY</p>
<p>6.0 PCT BUNDESANLEIHE DUE 2006</p>
<p> PUT	 101.0 PCT  2.36 DEM   4.56 PCT   43.79 X  12.MAR.98</p>
<p>6.0 PCT BUNDESANLEIHE DUE 2007</p>
<p> CALL	105.0 PCT  0.59 DEM   2.46 PCT  174.66 X  15.JAN.98</p>
<p> PUT	 101.0 PCT  2.47 DEM   4.39 PCT   41.72 X  15.JAN.98</p>
<p>6.25 PCT BUNDESANLEIHE DUE 2024</p>
<p> CALL	102.0 PCT  1.30 DEM   5.11 PCT   75.60 X  11.MAR.98</p>
<p> PUT	  94.0 PCT  3.37 DEM   7.78 PCT   29.16 X  11.MAR.98</p>
<p> PUT	  97.0 PCT  4.80 DEM   6.19 DEM   20.48 X  11.MAR.98</p>
<p> PAYDATE    06.MAR.97		LISTING    FFT DDF</p>
<p>--Reuter London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
